OL,5,G1100 Traffic Cops: Over the Limit
OL,6,     FCops clamp down on young drivers
OL,7,     Fand repeat offenders losing
OL,8,     Fcontrol while drink driving,
OL,9,     Fputting lives in danger, including
OL,10,     Fa suspected drink driver speeding
OL,11,     Fat 100mph.
OL,12,G1200 Traffic Cops
OL,13,     FExtreme weather conditions play a
OL,14,     Frole in the death or serious
OL,15,     Finjury of four people a day on
OL,16,     FUK's roads. In this edition, cops
OL,17,     Fdeal with dangerous drivers who
OL,18,     Fput lives at risk.
