OL,5,G1300 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FAn estimated #10 billion worth of
OL,7,     Fillegal drugs are sold in the UK
OL,8,     Fevery year. In this episode, cops
OL,9,     Fcrack down on drug gangs ruling
OL,10,     Fthrough fear and dealers cashing
OL,11,     Fin on victims.
OL,12,G1400 Police Interceptors
OL,13,     FA petrol thief runs out of gas,
OL,14,     Fthe helicopter follows a car thief
OL,15,     Fto the fair and a drunk driver
OL,16,     Fdoes not have to travel far to be
OL,17,     Fpatched up.
OL,18,G1500 Police Interceptors
OL,19,     FThere is a hair-raising pursuit
OL,20,     Fthrough the market town of Ripley
OL,21,     Fwhich sees a driver mounting
OL,22,     Fpavements.
