OL,5,G1800 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FDocumentary series. Dr Watson
OL,7,     Foffers 'talking therapy' to a
OL,8,     Fyoung lady who recently lost her
OL,9,     Fmother and Dr Bower treats a
OL,10,     Fgentleman who is plagued by
OL,11,     Fsuicidal thoughts.
OL,12,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,13,     FDr Pelly sees regular patient
OL,14,     FDavid who is suffering from the
OL,15,     Frepercussions of mouth cancer.
OL,16,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,17,     FBarnsley's A&E department is put
OL,18,     Funder the microscope. Advanced
OL,19,     FNurse Practitioner Dave tries to
OL,20,     Fget to the bottom of a patient's
OL,21,     Fpuzzling symptom - her tongue has
OL,22,     Fturned black!
