OL,5,G2100 A&E After Dark
OL,6,     FPatients include a man with
OL,7,     Flife-threatening brain injuries
OL,8,     Ffrom a punch, a 22-year-old with
OL,9,     Fpossible internal injuries after a
OL,10,     Fmotorbike crash, and an
OL,11,     F81-year-old with a head injury.
OL,12,G2200 Ambulance: Code Red
OL,13,     FCritical care teams race to save
OL,14,     Flives as a 61-year-old is injured
OL,15,     Fin a motorcycle crash, a new mum
OL,16,     Fhaemorrhages days after giving
OL,17,     Fbirth, and a 12-year-old suffers
OL,18,     Fsevere leg injuries.
