OL,10,     Fget to the bottom of a mystery
OL,11,     Fskin condition.
OL,12,G0000 Don't Tell the Doctor
OL,13,     FReality series. Kyran has a lump
OL,14,     Fabove his eye, Coco's attempts to
OL,15,     Fremove a scar made it worse, Sammi
OL,16,     Fhas extreme facial hair, and Luke
OL,17,     Fis in agony whenever he pees.
